<title>UK: THIN ENQUIRY MOSTLY TESTS PRICES IN EUROPE COTTON.</title>
<headline>THIN ENQUIRY MOSTLY TESTS PRICES IN EUROPE COTTON.</headline>
<dateline>LIVERPOOL 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The holiday season again subdued European raw cotton markets with enquiry confined almost entirely to testing prices.</p>
<p>Attention was on such growths as Greek, Spanish and West African. Eastern Europe was also featureless and long staple varieties were neglected.</p>
</text>
